><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336070/extras/93b4d47a3f0d97a5b719b89453e07a4e.mp4?t=1755544570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature an array of bosses, cutscenes, and small puzzles for players to solve. Frenzied, comedic, cartoonish animations in the irreverent style of an Adult Swim cartoon pair with maximalist game design choices for over-the-top action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336070/extras/20f55dcdd329034e85fb6d56df6cac36.poster.avif?t=1755544570\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336070/extras/20f55dcdd329034e85fb6d56df6cac36.webm?t=1755544570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336070/extras/20f55dcdd329034e85fb6d56df6cac36.mp4?t=1755544570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>This is a work of fiction. Any similarity to actual persons, living or dead or undead, or actual events, is purely coincidental.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "An adrenaline fueled FPS/boomer shooter about a buff barbarian hacker taking down an evil undead corporate overlord",
